 "title": "Gordon Chester",
 "intro": "Gordon Chester is running for election to the San Jose City Council to represent District 9 in California. He is on the ballot in the general election on November 3, 2026. He advanced from the primary on June 2, 2026.\nChester completed Ballotpedia's Candidate Connection survey in 2026. Click here to read the survey answers.",
